#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/centos7template.rst:2
msgid "Creating a CentOS 7 |morpheus| Image"
msgstr "Crear CentOS 7 |morpheus| Image"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/centos7template.rst:5
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/centos7template.rst:7
msgid ""
"|morpheus| comes out of the box with a default set of blueprints for use "
"in many modern deployment scenarios. These consist mostly of base "
"operating system images with a few additional adjustments. These "
"adjustments typically include the addition of cloud-init (which is highly"
" recommended to be used in most environments, but not mandatory). "
"However, in many on-premise deployments there are custom image "
"requirements as well as networking requirements. This guide will go over "
"how to create a base CentOS 7 Image for use within |morpheus|."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| comes out of el box con un predeterminado set of blueprints "
"para use in muchos modern deployment scenarios. These consist mostly of "
"base operating sistema images con un few adicional adjustments. These "
"adjustments típicamente include el addition of cloud-init (cual es highly"
" recomendado to be used in la mayoría entornos, pero no mandatory). Sin "
"embargo, in muchos on-premise deployments allí son personalizado image "
"requirements así como networking requirements. This guía será go over how"
" to create un base CentOS 7 Image para use dentro de |morpheus|."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/centos7template.rst:10
msgid "Creating a CentOS 7 |morpheus| VMware Image"
msgstr "Crear CentOS 7 |morpheus| VMware Image"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/centos7template.rst:13
msgid "VMWare"
msgstr "VMWare"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/centos7template.rst:15
msgid ""
"When running in VMWare it is highly recommended that VMware Tools be "
"installed. Without it, |morpheus| will have difficulty assessing the host"
" ip address and performing some additional automation tasks for the "
"operating system."
msgstr ""
"When running in VMWare it es highly recomendado que VMware Tools be "
"instalado. Without it, |morpheus| será tienen difficulty assessing el "
"host ip dirección y performing algunos adicional automation tasks para el"
" operating sistema."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/centos7template.rst:18
msgid "Cloud-Init"
msgstr "Cloud-Init"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/centos7template.rst:20
msgid ""
"To get started with a base CentOS image we first install cloud-init. This"
" is a relatively simple process using yum:"
msgstr ""
"To get started con un base CentOS image we primero install cloud-init. "
"This es un relatively simple proceso using yum:"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/centos7template.rst:22
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"yum -y install epel-release\n"
"yum -y install git wget ntp curl cloud-init dracut-modules-growroot\n"
"rpm -qa kernel | sed 's/^kernel-//'  | xargs -I {} dracut -f "
"/boot/initramfs-{}.img {}"
msgstr ""
"yum -y install epel-release\n"
"yum -y install git wget ntp curl cloud-init dracut-modules-growroot\n"
"rpm -qa kernel | sed 's/^kernel-//'  | xargs -I {} dracut -f "
"/boot/initramfs-{}.img {}"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/centos7template.rst:28
msgid ""
"There are two parts to this yum installation. We are first ensuring some "
"core dependencies are installed for automation as well as cloud-init. git"
" for example is installed for use by ansible playbook automation down the"
" line and is therefore optional if not using ansible. The dracut-modules-"
"growroot is responsible for resizing the root partition upon first boot "
"to match the virtual disk size that was potentially adjusted during "
"provisioning."
msgstr ""
"There son two parts to este yum instalación. We son primero ensuring "
"algunos core dependencies son instalado para automation así como cloud-"
"init. git por ejemplo es instalado para use by ansible playbook "
"automation down el line y es por lo tanto opcional if no using ansible. "
"The dracut-modules-growroot es responsable de resizing el root partition "
"sobre primero boot to match el virtual disk tamaño que fue potentially "
"adjusted durante provisioning."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/centos7template.rst:30
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A great benefit to using cloud-init is credentials don't have to be "
"locked into the blueprint. It is advisable, within |morpheus| , to "
"configure the default cloud-init user that gets created when the vm boots"
" automatically by cloud-init. This is located in the Cloud-Init Settings "
"section at :menuselection:`Administration --> Settings --> Provisioning`."
msgstr ""
"A great benefit to using cloud-init es credentials don't tienen to be "
"locked en el blueprint. It es advisable, dentro de |morpheus| , to "
"configure el predeterminado cloud-init user que gets creado cuando el vm "
"boots automáticamente by cloud-init. This es located in el Cloud-Init "
"Settings sección at |AdmSetPro|."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/centos7template.rst:33
msgid "Network Interfaces"
msgstr "Network Interfaces"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/centos7template.rst:35
msgid ""
"A slightly annoying change with centOS 7 is that the network interfaces "
"have changed naming convention. You may notice when running ifconfig that"
" the primary network interface is set to something like ens2344 or some "
"other random number. This naming is dynamic typically by hardware id and "
"we don't want this to fluctuate when provisioning the blueprint in "
"various VMware environments. Fortunately, there is a way to turn this "
"functionality off and restore the interface back to eth0."
msgstr ""
"A slightly annoying cambio con centOS 7 es que la red interfaces tienen "
"cambiado naming convention. You no puedeice cuando running ifconfig que "
"el primario network interfaz es set to something like ens2344 o algunos "
"otro random número. This naming es dynamic típicamente by hardware id y "
"we don't want este to fluctuate cuando provisioning el blueprint in "
"various VMware entornos. Fortunately, allí es un way to turn este "
"functionality off y restore el interfaz back to eth0."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/centos7template.rst:37
msgid ""
"Firstly we need to adjust our bootloader to disable interface naming like"
" this."
msgstr ""
"Firstly we need to adjust our bootloader to disable interfaz naming like "
"este."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/centos7template.rst:39
msgid ""
"sed -i -e 's/quiet/quiet net.ifnames=0 biosdevname=0/' /etc/default/grub\n"
"grub2-mkconfig -o /boot/grub2/grub.cfg"
msgstr ""
"sed -i -e 's/quiet/quiet net.ifnames=0 biosdevname=0/' "
"/etc/predeterminado/grub\n"
"grub2-mkconfig -o /boot/grub2/grub.cfg"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/centos7template.rst:45
msgid ""
"The above command adds a few arguments to the kernel args list (namely "
"``net.ifnames=0`` and ``biosdevname=0``. It may be useful to view the "
"``/etc/default/grub`` file and ensure these settings were indeed applied."
msgstr ""
"The anterior command adds un few arguments to el kernel args lista "
"(namely ``net.ifnames=0`` y ``biosdevname=0``. It puede be useful to view"
" el ``/etc/default/grub`` archivo y ensure estos configuración fueron "
"indeed applied."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/centos7template.rst:47
msgid ""
"The next step is to adjust the network-scripts in centOS. we need to "
"ensure we have a file called ``/etc/sysconfig/network-scripts/ifcfg-"
"eth0``"
msgstr ""
"The siguiente paso es to adjust la red-scripts in centOS. we need to "
"ensure we tienen un archivo called ``/etc/sysconfig/network-scripts"
"/ifcfg-eth0``"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/centos7template.rst:49
msgid ""
"Below is a script that we run on our packer builds to prepare the "
"machines network configuration files."
msgstr ""
"Below es un script que we run on our packer builds to prepare el machines"
" network configuración archivos."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/centos7template.rst:51
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"export iface_file=$(basename \"$(find /etc/sysconfig/network-scripts/ "
"-name 'ifcfg*' -not -name 'ifcfg-lo' | head -n 1)\")\n"
"export iface_name=${iface_file:6}\n"
"echo $iface_file\n"
"echo $iface_name\n"
"sudo mv /etc/sysconfig/network-scripts/$iface_file /etc/sysconfig"
"/network-scripts/ifcfg-eth0\n"
"sudo sed -i -e \"s/$iface_name/eth0/\" /etc/sysconfig/network-scripts"
"/ifcfg-eth0\n"
"sudo bash -c 'echo NM_CONTROLLED=\\\"no\\\" >> /etc/sysconfig/network-"
"scripts/ifcfg-eth0'"
msgstr ""
"export iface_file=$(basename \"$(find /etc/sysconfig/network-scripts/ "
"-nombre 'ifcfg*' -no -nombre 'ifcfg-lo' | head -n 1)\")\n"
"export iface_name=${iface_file:6}\n"
"echo $iface_file\n"
"echo $iface_name\n"
"sudo mv /etc/sysconfig/network-scripts/$iface_file /etc/sysconfig"
"/network-scripts/ifcfg-eth0\n"
"sudo sed -i -e \"s/$iface_name/eth0/\" /etc/sysconfig/network-scripts"
"/ifcfg-eth0\n"
"sudo bash -c 'echo NM_CONTROLLED=\\\"no\\\" >> /etc/sysconfig/network-"
"scripts/ifcfg-eth0'"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/centos7template.rst:62
msgid ""
"This script tries to ensure there is a new ifcfg-eth0 config created to "
"replace the old ens config file. Please do verify this config exists "
"after running. If it does not you will have to be sure to build one on "
"your own."
msgstr ""
"This script tries to ensure allí es un nuevo ifcfg-eth0 config creado to "
"replace el old ens config archivo. Please do verify este config exists "
"después de running. If it no you será tienen to be sure to build one on "
"your own."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/centos7template.rst:64
msgid ""
"TYPE=Ethernet\n"
"DEVICE=eth0\n"
"NAME=eth0\n"
"ONBOOT=yes\n"
"NM_CONTROLLED=\"no\"\n"
"BOOTPROTO=\"dhcp\"\n"
"DEFROUTE=yes"
msgstr ""
"TYPE=Ethernet\n"
"DEVICE=eth0\n"
"NAME=eth0\n"
"ONBOOT=yes\n"
"NM_CONTROLLED=\"no\"\n"
"BOOTPROTO=\"dhcp\"\n"
"DEFROUTE=yes"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/centos7template.rst:76
msgid "Gotchas"
msgstr "Gotchas"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/centos7template.rst:78
msgid ""
"SELinux can cause issues with cloud-init when in enforced mode. It may be"
" advisable to set this to permissive unless it is mandatory within your "
"organization to use an enforced SELinux configuration. If that is the "
"case please see the documentation for the cloud_init_t security policies."
msgstr ""
"SELinux puede cause issues con cloud-init cuando in enforced modo. It "
"puede be advisable to set este to permissive unless it es mandatory "
"dentro de your organization to use un enforced SELinux configuración. If "
"que es el case please see el documentación para la nube_init_t security "
"policies."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/centos7template.rst:80
msgid ""
"Network Manager will also prevent the required restart of the Network "
"Service when assigning static IP's. Disable Network Manager when possible"
" or Static IP assignment may not work until the Network Service is "
"restarted manually."
msgstr ""
"Network Manager será también prevent el requerido restart of el Network "
"Service cuando assigning static IP's. Disable Network Manager cuando "
"possible o Static IP assignment no puede work hasta el Network Service es"
" restarted manualmente."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/centos7template.rst:83
msgid "A Note on Proxies"
msgstr "A Note on Proxies"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/centos7template.rst:85
msgid ""
"Proxy configurations are known to vary in some organizations and makes "
"building a base blueprint a little more difficult. In order to fully "
"configure proxies a few environment variables must be set in the "
"`/etc/environment` file (This can be done automatically in a default "
"user-data script for cloud-init as well in edit cloud)."
msgstr ""
"Proxy configurations son known to vary in algunos organizations y makes "
"building un base blueprint un little más difficult. In order to fully "
"configure proxies un few entorno variables debe estar establecido in el "
"`/etc/entorno` archivo (This puede be done automáticamente in un "
"predeterminado user-datos script para cloud-init as well in edit cloud)."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/centos7template.rst:87
msgid ""
"http_proxy=\"http://myproxyaddress:8080\"\n"
"https_proxy=\"http://myproxyaddress:8080\"\n"
"ftp_proxy=\"http://myproxyaddress:8080\"\n"
"no_proxy=127.0.0.1,localhost,applianceUrl\n"
"https_no_proxy=127.0.0.1,localhost,applianceUrl"
msgstr ""
"http_proxy=\"http://myproxyaddress:8080\"\n"
"https_proxy=\"http://myproxyaddress:8080\"\n"
"ftp_proxy=\"http://myproxyaddress:8080\"\n"
"no_proxy=127.0.0.1,localhost,applianceUrl\n"
"https_no_proxy=127.0.0.1,localhost,applianceUrl"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/centos7template.rst:96
#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/centos7template.rst:100
msgid "Important"
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/centos7template.rst:96
msgid ""
"It is very important to properly set the no_proxy list (applianceUrl) "
"should be replaced with the actual appliance url. In future releases, "
"morpheus plans to automatically take care of this."
msgstr ""
"It es muy importante to properly set el no_proxy lista (applianceUrl) "
"debería be replaced con el actual appliance url. In future releases, "
"morpheus plans to automáticamente take care of este."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/centos7template.rst:98
msgid "Note"
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/centos7template.rst:98
msgid ""
"If using cloud-init agent install mode these settings need to be set in "
"the custom Cloud-Init User data section of “Edit Cloud” or “Edit Virtual "
"Image”"
msgstr ""
"If using cloud-init agent install modo estos configuración need to be set"
" in el personalizado Cloud-Init User datos sección of “Edit Cloud” o "
"“Edit Virtual Image”"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/centos7template.rst:100
msgid ""
"If using this virtual machine as a docker host, proxy settings must also "
"be configured in the docker config. See Docker guides for instructions on"
" how to properly set this. If necessary this can be wrapped in a task "
"automation workflow for your own use."
msgstr ""
"If using este virtual machine as un docker host, proxy configuración debe"
" también be configurado in el docker config. See Docker guides para "
"instructions on how to properly set este. If necesario este puede be "
"wrapped in una tarea automation workflow para your own use."

